{"n": 46, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "46.webp", "text": "11-19\n\n1178010 CHECKING FUNCTION OF\nOXYGEN SENSOR\n\nCounterhold on hexagon (2), unscrew plug (1)\nand screw on Special Too! 13 0 090.\nMeasure CO bevel:\nSpecification: 0.7 to 1.2 % by volume.\n\nReter to 13 00 054 for addtional information.\n\nPull off and plug vacuum hose (1) on pressure\nregulator.\n\nCO fevel rises briefly and is regulated back to\nthe original value immediataly — oxygen\nsensor is working properly,\n\nDefective:\n\nCheck power supply to oxygen sensor via\nrelay according to the wiring diagram,\n\nRefer to Group 13 for additional information,\n\n1178510 REPLACING OXYGEN SENSOR\n\n— Do not clean the oxygen wentor and never\nlet it come in contact with a lubricant.\n\n— Only use Aati-Seize** on the threads.\n\n— Protect oxygen senaor when undercosting\nthe car.\n\nDisconnect plug (1).\n\nPull off plate (2),\n\nInstallation:\n(Coat threads with Amti-Seie**\nTightening torque*\n\n* See Specifications\n** Source: HWB", "words": [["11-19", 0.4723, 0.027, 0.5237, 0.0495], ["1178010", 0.2681, 0.0686, 0.317, 0.0805], ["CHECKING", 0.3301, 0.0686, 0.3871, 0.0805], ["FUNCTION", 0.3911, 0.0686, 0.4476, 0.0805], ["OF", 0.4506, 0.0686, 0.4662, 0.0805], ["OXYGEN", 0.3291, 0.0844, 0.377, 0.0963], ["SENSOR", 0.38, 0.0844, 0.4234, 0.0963], ["Counterhold", 0.2681, 0.1161, 0.4884, 0.1332], ["on", 0.3317, 0.1135, 0.3422, 0.1359], ["hexagon", 0.3473, 0.1135, 0.3851, 0.1359], ["(2),", 0.3886, 0.1135, 0.4078, 0.1359], ["unscrew", 0.4118, 0.1135, 0.4461, 0.1359], ["plug", 0.4516, 0.1135, 0.4708, 0.1359], ["(1)", 0.4758, 0.1135, 0.4904, 0.1359], ["and", 0.2651, 0.1306, 0.2828, 0.1491], ["screw", 0.2883, 0.1332, 0.3664, 0.1464], ["on", 0.3191, 0.1306, 0.3286, 0.1491], ["Special", 0.3342, 0.1332, 0.3664, 0.1464], ["Too!", 0.371, 0.1332, 0.3921, 0.1438], ["13", 0.3977, 0.1332, 0.4073, 0.1438], ["0", 0.4118, 0.1332, 0.4168, 0.1438], ["090.", 0.4194, 0.1332, 0.4395, 0.1438], ["Measure", 0.2681, 0.1491, 0.3523, 0.159